  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "wsdg: Document CMake idioms and plugin use",
  "description": "Add a section _ChToolsCMakeIdioms_ for describing our CMake idioms which\nmay surprise newer contributors. Include information about library\ndependencies, including a section about dependencies which may not be\nintuitively named.\n\nFlesh out the section of _ChapterPlugins_ involving the plugin's\n_CMakeLists.txt_ file so it describes the required components of the\nfile, rather than just instructing the reader to cargo-cult the same\nfile from the _gryphon_ plugin.\n\nAI-Assisted: No\n\nCloses #20680",
  "state": "merged",
