        {
          "id": 3151304667,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I don't know that it actually is boilerplate, that's why the comments are in the form of questions. (Also note that they are comments, they won't appear in the final doc.)\n\nIf we agree that it is in fact something to be addressed, then that would be its own issue/MR. This MR could be blocked on that, or we could push this one and have updating the documentation be a part of the other MR. We have 14 plugins in `plugins/epan/` so updating one doc file twice is only an incremental lift on top of fixing them all.",
